@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Operations Planner" as Planner
participant ":System" as System

activate Planner

    Planner -> System : requests Radius Search within R km
    activate System

        System --> Planner : shows search requirements\n(Target Lat/Lon, Radius R)\nand asks for input
    deactivate System

    Planner -> System : provides search parameters
    activate System

        System --> Planner : executes radius search on 2D-Tree\n(uses Haversine, BST/AVL insertion, pruning)
    deactivate System

    Planner -> System : acknowledges search
    activate System

        System --> Planner : displays results\n(List of stations within R km sorted by distance ASC, name DESC)\nSummary by country and isCity\nTemporal analysis complexity
    deactivate System

@enduml